# Opinion

Meeting: 0001-kickoff
Agent: Critic
Task: 
Context:
- Beginning RPS Arena as a separate project with ambitious performance + fairness goals.

Position:
- Early risks: scope creep (UI polish vs backend rigor), security gaps (auth/session), and reliance on in-memory defaults without Mongo validation.

Recommendations:
- Document assumptions and keep meeting notes current; prioritize server-authoritative rules and security basics even in MVP.
- Schedule a Mongo integration check soon to prevent late surprises.
